msgid "Sidebar playlist: add, sort, repeat and shuffle"
msgstr "侧栏播放列表：添加、排序、循环与随机"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"A playlist in the right sidebar: add files, folders and links, drag and drop, sort and search, repeat and shuffle, and add the similar files of the same folder when a file is opened; reads and writes M3U, M3U8 and PLS list files and restores the list after a restart.\n"
"Entry points: \"Playlist\" (F6) in the context menu and Playback ▸ Playlist."
msgstr ""
"右侧栏播放列表：添加文件、文件夹和链接，拖放加入，排序与搜索，循环与随机播放，打开文件时自动加入同文件夹的相似文件；读写 M3U、M3U8、PLS 列表文件，重启后恢复列表。\n"
"入口：右键菜单「播放列表」（F6）与「播放 ▸ 播放列表」。"

#: manifest.json
msgid "playlist"
msgstr "播放列表"

#: manifest.json
